        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "403365b5-8424-3f32-9ec1-5c477896ac35",
                "word": "inéluctablement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                        "entry_id": "403365b5-8424-3f32-9ec1-5c477896ac35",
                        "glosses": [
                            "D’une manière inéluctable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "922de956-a5aa-4f1a-af8a-797ab25c0489",
                                "sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                                "text": "La plupart des économistes modernes ont fait, des influences qui règlent le salaire, des lois naturelles qui s'imposent inéluctablement comme celles qui gouvernent les phénomènes physiques."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57658696-a324-4edb-8c0c-e5c8be793206",
                                "sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                                "text": "Les gens fabriquent eux-mêmes le mécanisme de leur malheur, ils remontent la clef à bloc et ensuite le mécanisme continue de tourner, inéluctablement, avec quelques ratés, quelques faiblesses lorsque la maladie s’en mêle, mais il continue de tourner jusqu’à la fin, jusqu’à la dernière seconde."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "73c0dcde-6a8c-481e-9fa9-2798a8563146",
                                "sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                                "text": "Mais la vraie question est de savoir si la réduction de consommation peut rester stable dans le temps ou si, chez les patients alcoolo-dépendants, elle conduit inéluctablement à une réaugmentation de celle-ci."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fa236a25-ee59-4f36-a7f0-21c958fa4688",
                        "source_entry_id": "403365b5-8424-3f32-9ec1-5c477896ac35",
                        "source_sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                        "target_lang_word": "ineluctably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ineluctably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bf21b2d-b1d2-35bc-aba6-6f587b965659",
                                        "entry_id": "f5c0e062-ddc9-3b54-a4ce-931e234d145c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an ineluctable manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2187eeec-6ee4-4723-9ab4-8462efb91627",
                                                "sense_id": "8bf21b2d-b1d2-35bc-aba6-6f587b965659",
                                                "text": "Ineluctably I was led to believe that the first whisperers of these accursed tales must have had discourse with Akeley’s Outer Ones, and perhaps have visited outer cosmic realms as Akeley now proposed visiting them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74fa3c53-845b-441d-91ea-b164324b5298",
                                                "sense_id": "8bf21b2d-b1d2-35bc-aba6-6f587b965659",
                                                "text": "So insistent is the presence of money in Newport that the mind springs ineluctably to the raw beginnings of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f7f5ebe8-2557-46c8-92a8-d0db1a6aeab6",
                        "source_entry_id": "403365b5-8424-3f32-9ec1-5c477896ac35",
                        "source_sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
                        "target_lang_word": "inescapably",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inescapably",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "166f142e-7281-3f17-9c43-8d5465b9d6e3",
                                        "entry_id": "526c23f5-1e42-33e4-9517-e65a01e55ced",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an inescapable manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d22bf5f2-88db-496b-b7c6-e136a69af4ba",
                                                "sense_id": "166f142e-7281-3f17-9c43-8d5465b9d6e3",
                                                "text": "Thus Clement Stone, though he has toe-dipped and waded and sometimes plunged into many ventures during the course of a busy life, is still inescapably labeled as an insurance man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc140278-e388-48ae-a501-2ddeaea13d51",
                                                "sense_id": "166f142e-7281-3f17-9c43-8d5465b9d6e3",
                                                "text": "He eventually nails his colours to the mast of strict determinism: every human action is inescapably caused by preceding events in the world, including events in the brain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d48306eb-55cf-4f43-bc57-7675c7dc705a",
                        "source_entry_id": "403365b5-8424-3f32-9ec1-5c477896ac35",
                        "source_sense_id": "7292fb5b-3c3c-360e-9ab4-ed8516bf8f39",
